[00:07.05]I'm obsessed with the idea of you
[00:07.05]我痴迷于你的想法
[00:10.12]How you carry yourself is your superpower
[00:10.12]你的举止是你的超能力
[00:13.97]Don't care what anybody thinks of you
[00:13.97]无需在意别人的看法
[00:17.24]Wish I could say the same
[00:17.24]真希望我也能这么说
[00:20.50]I pretend to like what's in the mirror
[00:20.50]我假装喜欢镜子里的东西
[00:26.83]While you look at me so proud to be her
[00:26.83]当你看着我为成为她而骄傲时
[00:33.38]I can't see
[00:33.38]我看不清
[00:35.84]What you see in me
[00:35.84]你眼中的我
[00:37.81]What you see in me
[00:37.81]你眼中的我
[00:40.43]All I see
[00:40.43]我所看到的
[00:43.02]Is somebody that I barely know
[00:43.02]是一个趋近陌生的人
